Task: Identify the top 10 regions (counties) with the highest total number of SNAP-participating households, using the 2017 5-year ACS county-level data and SNAP enrollment data from January 1, 2017, excluding regions where the total SNAP participation is zero. For each of these regions, calculate the ratio of households earning under $20,000 to the total number of SNAP-participating households.

